+
+Connect to your Wordpress site seamlessly over SFTP.
+
+## Connection Settings
+
+Click [here](/sftp-settings) to see the settings. **It's important** to use port 2222.
+
+Each site supports up to 50 simultaneous SFTP users.
+
+Mac users can use the best SFTP client, Cyberduck.
